00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:27.139
<v News>動物園のみんなが、赤ちゃんが大きくなるのを、楽しみにしています。

00:06:27.839 --> 00:06:31.872
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:32.471 --> 00:06:38.591
<v Slow>アムールヒョウの赤ちゃんは、どこで生まれましたか。

00:06:39.391 --> 00:06:43.951
<v Host>At Asahiyama Zoo, in the city of Asahikawa in Hokkaido.

00:06:44.552 --> 00:06:50.336
<v Slow>赤ちゃんのお父さんは、どこから来ましたか。

00:06:51.136 --> 00:06:55.384
<v Host>He came from Denmark. He is a three-year-old male leopard.

00:06:55.983 --> 00:07:02.824
<v Slow>野生のアムールヒョウは、世界に何頭ぐらいいますか。

00:07:03.624 --> 00:07:08.519
<v Host>Only about one hundred. That is why this baby is so precious.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:21.504
<v Host>That's all for today. With only about one hundred left in the wild, every new baby brings hope for this beautiful leopard. I hope we can all meet the little one at the zoo soon. See you tomorrow.

00:07:22.103 --> 00:07:24.504
<v News>また明日。
